<title>JAPAN: Olympus - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Olympus - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 92.86		vs	   85.92</p>
<p> Operating	    4.50		vs	    2.03</p>
<p> Current		2.21		vs	    2.15</p>
<p> Net		    2.05		vs	    1.47</p>
<p> EPS		    7.77 yen	  vs	    5.55 yen</p>
<p> Shares	    264 million	  vs	 264 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.50 yen	  vs	    6.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Olympus Optical Co Ltd is a leading manufacturer of cameras.</p>
